# <<app>> feature map

One file per user-facing feature, from the user's point of view: what it is, how to reach it, how to drive it, what observable end state proves it works. These files teach how to *use* a feature, not how it is built; read the code for internals. This map is the maintained verification source for <<app>>: frontmatter (`id`, `surface`, `profile`, `paths`, `always_with`) is machine-read by `verify.mjs`.

